   "id": 669158,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\">\n    <li>Here are graphs of functions <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> and <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>.\n  <p>Each represents the height of an object being launched into the air as a function of time.</p></li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <p><img alt=\"Graphs of functions f and g. Vertical axis, height. Horizontal axis, time. Function f begins low on the y axis, increases in height quickly, then ends at about halfway down the x axis. Function g begins high on the y axis, moves gradually downward, and ends toward the end of the x axis.\" height=\"184\" src=\"exercises/media/7817a7742b514bf1.svg\" width=\"284\"></p>\n  <ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n    <li>Which object was launched from a higher point?</li>\n    </ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1334015,
     "content_html": "The object represented by function <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1334016,
     "content_html": "The object represented by function <span data-math=\"f\">f</span>"
    }
   ],
